  "body": "## Summary\n- preserve historical Observer rows across price-range/target changes using tracking generations\n- keep analytics and publication-time reads scoped to the active generation\n- count active additional targets as real model coverage\n- replace the stale fixed 5 conversations/day assumption with adaptive confirmed FIRST_OFFER throughput from the last 28 days\n- expose the effective daily/weekly capacity in Price Matrix\n- show the configured Observer price sample range in Statistics\n- normalize weekly/monthly market pace from daily rate\n- canonicalize missed opportunities as REJECTED + reason at write time\n- defer new Observer browser batches when host memory is under pressure\n- add regression tests for generation resets, additional-target planning, adaptive capacity, and memory guard\n\n## Safety\n- no negotiation submit/quota/session code changed\n- hard 25/day offer quota remains untouched\n- Observer remains anonymous/read-only",
